{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026DtMlmPZV671792846624.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>法國巴黎有學生示威。他們在巴黎遊行，指不滿學校的環境惡劣，以及政府的有關政策，令生活開支上漲。</p><p></p><p>因應早前的示威演變為騷亂，加上「黃背心」運動聲稱在全國發起500多場示威，要求總統馬克龍下台，法國內政部今次在全國多地部署大批警察和憲兵，還有水炮車及裝甲車等。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FR.PROTEST 2030.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ebgensijaj1792846633.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>多個城市採取不同的應對措施，巴黎當局批准學生及工會的遊行，但必須按照指定、遠離市中心的路線進行。</p><p></p><p>總統馬克龍據報推遲原定下周訪問西非尼日利亞及塞內加爾行程。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T14:40:18.322357+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T20:58:06.685496+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T14:36:53.122813+00:00","content_hash":"3daa7a0a5018498dbdd88573dfb072af7d5e7df149fa38eea801e3ab5e7ce864","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}